ftp://ftp.*.kernel.org (put your country code instead of *) get
Andrea Arcangeli patches for RTC_LIGHT, patch, configure and compile
your kernel with that; I would not recommend a full RTC on Alpha
for various reasons.  This will not help with other iopl uses, though.

